# env:c5_lcd147 only (Waveshare ESP32-C5-LCD-1.47), on top of sdkconfig.defaults and
# sdkconfig.defaults.esp32c5.

# The SPI master driver (the display) brings ~10 KB of IRAM with its interrupt
# handler there, which pushes static data into the SDR's capture bank. Run it from
# flash: a late display interrupt doesn't matter, and the timing loop outranks the
# screen's task.
# CONFIG_SPI_MASTER_ISR_IN_IRAM is not set
